  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The information submitted is of insufficient quality and content to be able to make an accurate assessment in terms of residential amenities. In the absence of an odour report; officers are unable to make an accurate assessment in terms of odour amenity impacts of the proposed development, detrimental to the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers. The proposal is therefore, contrary to policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the siting and scale of the proposed ducting and flue in proximity to residential windows, would result in an unacceptable adverse impact on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers with regard to outlook. As such the proposed development is contrary to policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033(2020).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its detailed design, position and location would result in an obtrusive and incompatible form of development which adversely disrupts the established grain of the area and would consequently fail to preserve or enhance terrace within which the property is located and the character and appearance of the surrounding conservation area. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) and HC1 (Heritage Conservation and Growth) of the London Plan 2021, policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
